./odf_spec/OpenDocument-v1.4-os-part3-schema.txt:23851:The style:width attribute is usable with the following element: <style:footnote-sep> 17.4.
./odf_spec/OpenDocument-v1.4-os-part3-schema.txt:23853:The style:width attribute has the data type length 18.3.19.
